### Analytics & Scans Tests
@base = http://localhost:3001
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@qrId = PASTE_QR_ID_HERE

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECTION 1 — GLOBAL ANALYTICS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1.1 Global analytics — default (30 days)
# EXPECT: 200, totalScans, uniqueScans, topQRs, deviceBreakdown, locationBreakdown
GET {{base}}/api/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 1.2 Global analytics — last 7 days
GET {{base}}/api/analytics?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 1.3 Global analytics — max range (90 days)
GET {{base}}/api/analytics?days=90
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 1.4 Global analytics — out-of-range days
# EXPECT: 422
GET {{base}}/api/analytics?days=999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 1.5 Global analytics — unauthenticated
# EXPECT: 401
GET {{base}}/api/analytics

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECTION 2 — PER-QR ANALYTICS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2.1 QR analytics — valid QR, 30 days
# EXPECT: 200, scanTimeline array, deviceTypes, locations
GET {{base}}/api/qr/{{qrId}}/analytics?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2.2 QR analytics — 7 day window
GET {{base}}/api/qr/{{qrId}}/analytics?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2.3 QR analytics — another user's QR (IDOR check)
# EXPECT: 404
GET {{base}}/api/qr/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/analytics?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECTION 3 — SCAN LOGS (v1 polling endpoint)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3.1 Get recent scans for a QR (v1 API key auth)
# EXPECT: 200, array of scan objects
# Requires: valid API key from /app/api-keys
GET {{base}}/v1/qr/{{qrId}}/scans?limit=25
Authorization: Bearer nxqr_live_YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

###

### 3.2 Scans — limit capped at 100
GET {{base}}/v1/qr/{{qrId}}/scans?limit=999
Authorization: Bearer nxqr_live_YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

###

### 3.3 Scans — no API key
# EXPECT: 401
GET {{base}}/v1/qr/{{qrId}}/scans

###
